End-to-end data engineering pipeline designed to ingest, process, validate and analyze e-commerce sales data.

🚀 Overview

This project simulates a real-world data engineering environment where sales, customer and product data are collected from different sources, processed through an automated ETL pipeline and stored in analytical layers for reporting and decision-making.

The pipeline implements data ingestion, transformation, data quality validation, orchestration and analytical storage using modern data engineering tools.

